{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__18_.gif?t=1748567731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Incredible things coming out of Latin America right now&quot; - kenkaioh (NRZGAMES)<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__2___1_.gif?t=1748567731\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__5___2___1___2_.gif?t=1748567731\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><u>CURSOR BLAST</u></i></strong> is a SPACE SHOOTER in the style of old school SHMUPs with spaceships, heavily inspired by those from the Nintendo and Super Nintendo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IT'S A TRIBUTE TO THE GAMES OF THE 90'S, TO THE <span class=\"bb_strike\">BOOTLEG</span> GAMES OF THE 90'S, WHERE ONE GAME WAS RELEASED AND A THOUSANDS OF SIMILAR GAMES CAME WITH IT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>to infinity and beyond</strong>, want to play <u><i>5 minutes</i></u>? <i><strong>Make yourself comfortable</strong></i>. Want to play <u><i>60 hours in a row</i></u>? <i><strong>Feel free</strong></i> too, <span class=\"bb_strike\">if you can stay alive</span> with your ship by then.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOU ARE A SPACE SHOOTER THAT, IN ORDER TO SURVIVE HUGE HOARDS OF ENEMIES, <u>NEEDS TO SHOOT AND AIM WITH THE MOUSE INSTEAD OF STRAIGHT SHOTS</u>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YOUR <strong>COMFORT</strong> OF JUST PASSING IN FRONT OF THEM TO HIT THEM IS OVER, YOU'RE DRIVING, SO YOU AIM TO HIT THE ENEMIES.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/2025-05-17_03-04-16.gif?t=1748567731\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your stylish movement skills to stay mobile and avoid the relentless attacks of the most varied enemies.\u00a0<strong><i><u>Aim with your mouse</u></i></strong> and take advantage of the <i><u>non-linear aiming</u></i>!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ALL GAME IMPROVEMENTS ARE CHOSEN BY CARDS AFTER THE END OF A WORD.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/New_Piskel__5___2___1___3_.gif?t=1748567731\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> INFINITE STAGES PASSING THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE <i><u>GALACTIC STATE</u></i>, <strong><i><u><span class=\"bb_strike\">HELL IS HEAVEN</span> COMPARED TO QUANTITY!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LIVE AS LONG AS YOU CAN! CARDS HAVE RARITY! POSSIBLE NEW POST-LAUNCH MODES PLANNED ACCORDING TO NEXT UPDATES;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EAT A <strong>BIG STEAK AND DRINK\u00a0 SUGAR CANE JUICE</strong> WHILE PLAYING THIS <strong><i><u>WONDER!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLAY THE GAME WITH ALL YOU CAN, WHO KNOWS YOU MAY GET THE <strong>PLATINUM </strong>ONE DAY, WHO KNOWS!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691030?t=1748567731","background_r